  "title": "BGP: Branch-aware Graph Planning for Reliable Goal-Conditioned Reinforcement Learning",
  "summary": "BGP addresses offline goal-conditioned reinforcement learning by capturing stochastic branching structures and designing goal-conditioned edges with segmented learning to avoid unreliable branches, enabling reliable goal reaching even in highly stochastic environments. It significantly improves performance on diverse OGBench tasks and addresses the challenge of path mirage.",
